        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ebitong'ile khubioluyiitsi ebia abandu abo belihe bayaaya, mbiebino; mbu amakondi ebikhumila ebikhumi bisasaba namakhumi musaafu nakaraano, ",
          "type": "text",
