              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshitonye shiabio, eshiali omukabo kwabo abatsia mwihe, obunji bwabio mbwobuno; mbu amakondi ebikhumila ebikhumi bitaru namusaafu nebikhumi biraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
