              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamusunjila Musa bari Ifwe abasumbabo khubalile obunji bwabasaatsa belihe abali mubulindi bwefwe, ne shibaleemilekhwo omundu kata mulala ta ",
          "type": "text",
