              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khuleerile eshihaanwa shiOMWAMI, khubindu ebia buli mundu anyoolile, mbu ebimili bieitsahaabu, nemikotse, nemikasa, netsingaka tsieshibalikho, netsingaka etsiomushirwi, nebichechele, mbu khutiswe imbeli wOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
