          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo Musa naEleazari omukuhani nibabukula tsitsahaabu etsio etsia abaseesia bebikhumila nabebikhumi baleera, nibatsileera mwiheema liokhwakaana, tsibe eshiitsulilo shiabaana haIsiraeli imbeli wOMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
